# "Klingons and Warriors you control have vigilance": Creakwood Safewright (an Elf Warrior) attacks and is not tapped
# (CR 702.20b). "You control" is Bot1 alone: Bot2's own Creakwood Safewright gets nothing from Bot1's Spacecraft and taps
# when it attacks.

[Bot1 Deck]
I.K.S. Negh'Var, Imperial Flagship
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Creakwood Safewright
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Creakwood Safewright
Island x17

[Actions]
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.I.K.S. Negh'Var, Imperial Flagship.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Creakwood Safewright.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Creakwood Safewright.Cast
? Bot2.Mana =
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Creakwood Safewright.Keywords = Vigilance
? Bot2.Battlefield.Creakwood Safewright.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Attack(Creakwood Safewright > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Creakwood Safewright.Tapped = false
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Creakwood Safewright > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Creakwood Safewright.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Creakwood Safewright.Tapped = false
Bot2.Battlefield.Creakwood Safewright.Tapped = true
